  "notes": {
    "migration": "OpenAI removes these models from the API on 2024-01-04: text-ada-001, text-babbage-001, text-curie-001, text-davinci-001, text-davinci-002, text-davinci-003, ada, babbage, curie, davinci, code-davinci-002, text-davinci-edit-001, code-davinci-edit-001, text-similarity-ada-001, text-search-ada-doc-001, text-search-ada-query-001, code-search-ada-code-001, code-search-ada-text-001, text-similarity-babbage-001, text-search-babbage-doc-001, text-search-babbage-query-001, code-search-babbage-code-001, code-search-babbage-text-001, text-similarity-curie-001, text-search-curie-doc-001, text-search-curie-query-001, text-similarity-davinci-001, text-search-davinci-doc-001, text-search-davinci-query-001. Calls that name them fail after that date. Recommended replacements: text-ada-001 to gpt-3.5-turbo-instruct; text-babbage-001 to gpt-3.5-turbo-instruct; text-curie-001 to gpt-3.5-turbo-instruct; text-davinci-001 to gpt-3.5-turbo-instruct; text-davinci-002 to gpt-3.5-turbo-instruct; text-davinci-003 to gpt-3.5-turbo-instruct; ada to babbage-002; babbage to babbage-002; curie to davinci-002; davinci to davinci-002; code-davinci-002 to gpt-3.5-turbo-instruct; text-davinci-edit-001 to gpt-4o; code-davinci-edit-001 to gpt-4o; ada to babbage-002; babbage to babbage-002; curie to davinci-002; davinci to davinci-002, gpt-3.5-turbo, gpt-4o; text-similarity-ada-001 to text-embedding-3-small; text-search-ada-doc-001 to text-embedding-3-small; text-search-ada-query-001 to text-embedding-3-small; code-search-ada-code-001 to text-embedding-3-small; code-search-ada-text-001 to text-embedding-3-small; text-similarity-babbage-001 to text-embedding-3-small; text-search-babbage-doc-001 to text-embedding-3-small; text-search-babbage-query-001 to text-embedding-3-small; code-search-babbage-code-001 to text-embedding-3-small; code-search-babbage-text-001 to text-embedding-3-small; text-similarity-curie-001 to text-embedding-3-small; text-search-curie-doc-001 to text-embedding-3-small; text-search-curie-query-001 to text-embedding-3-small; text-similarity-davinci-001 to text-embedding-3-small; text-search-davinci-doc-001 to text-embedding-3-small; text-search-davinci-query-001 to text-embedding-3-small. A newer model can answer differently, so test the switch rather than only renaming.",
    "edgeCases": [
      "A model name read from an environment variable, a config file or a variable set elsewhere is not found.",
      "A mocked API response that names the model, such as an msw or nock handler for the endpoint, is reported too.",
      "Azure OpenAI calls are reported too, though Azure names deployments its own way and sets its own retirement dates."
    ]
  },
